title: 'statement-store: v2 DHT soak zombienet test behind a PR label'
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: 'Adds an on-demand zombienet soak of the statement store v2 DHT path:
    a network sized nodes > replication_factor > gossip_target + 1 under continuous
    load, asserting subscriber delivery, placement on exactly the K XOR-closest nodes,
    and clean logs. Triggered by the GHA-statement-store PR label or a manual workflow
    dispatch onto the zombienet k8s cluster; not part of the default per-PR matrix.'
crates: []
